#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:33
msgid ""
"Construct an ``LSM9DS1`` instance, verify the WHO_AM_I registers of both "
"sub-devices, configure all three sensors and enable the accel/gyro FIFO in "
"continuous mode."
msgstr ""
"Construeer een ``LSM9DS1``\\ -instantie, verifieer de WHO_AM_I-registers van"
" beide subapparaten, configureer alle drie de sensoren en schakel de "
"accel/gyro-FIFO in continue modus in."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:37
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:38
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Een geconfigureerde :py:class:`machine.I2C`\\ -bus waaraan de sensor is "
"gekoppeld."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:40
msgid "``address_imu``"
msgstr "``address_imu``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:41
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the accelerometer/gyroscope sub-device. Defaults to "
"``0x6B``."
msgstr ""
"7-bits I2C-adres van het subapparaat van de versnellingsmeter/gyroscoop. "
"Standaard ``0x6B``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:44
msgid "``address_magnet``"
msgstr "``address_magnet``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:45
msgid ""
"7-bit I2C address of the magnetometer sub-device. Defaults to ``0x1E``."
msgstr ""
"7-bits I2C-adres van het subapparaat van de magnetometer. Standaard "
"``0x1E``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:48
msgid "``gyro_odr``"
msgstr "``gyro_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:49
msgid ""
"Gyroscope output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0`` (off), ``14.9``, "
"``59.5``, ``119``, ``238``, ``476`` or ``952``."
msgstr ""
"Output data rate van de gyroscoop in Hz. Moet een van de volgende zijn: "
"``0`` (uit), ``14.9``\\ , ``59.5``\\ , ``119``\\ , ``238``\\ , ``476`` of "
"``952``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:52
msgid "``gyro_scale``"
msgstr "``gyro_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:53
msgid ""
"Gyroscope full-scale range in degrees-per-second. Must be one of ``245``, "
"``500`` or ``2000``."
msgstr ""
"Full-scale bereik van de gyroscoop in graden per seconde. Moet een van de "
"volgende zijn: ``245``\\ , ``500`` of ``2000``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:56
msgid "``accel_odr``"
msgstr "``accel_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:57
msgid ""
"Accelerometer output data rate in Hz. Same set of values as ``gyro_odr``."
msgstr ""
"Output data rate van de versnellingsmeter in Hz. Dezelfde set waarden als "
"``gyro_odr``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:60
msgid "``accel_scale``"
msgstr "``accel_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:61
msgid ""
"Accelerometer full-scale range in g. Must be one of ``2``, ``4``, ``8`` or "
"``16``."
msgstr ""
"Full-scale bereik van de versnellingsmeter in g. Moet een van de volgende "
"zijn: ``2``\\ , ``4``\\ , ``8`` of ``16``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:64
msgid "``magnet_odr``"
msgstr "``magnet_odr``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:65
msgid ""
"Magnetometer output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``0.625``, ``1.25``, "
"``2.5``, ``5``, ``10``, ``20``, ``40`` or ``80``."
msgstr ""
"Output data rate van de magnetometer in Hz. Moet een van de volgende zijn: "
"``0.625``\\ , ``1.25``\\ , ``2.5``\\ , ``5``\\ , ``10``\\ , ``20``\\ , "
"``40`` of ``80``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:68
msgid "``magnet_scale``"
msgstr "``magnet_scale``"

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:69
msgid ""
"Magnetometer full-scale range in gauss. Must be one of ``4``, ``8``, ``12`` "
"or ``16``."
msgstr ""
"Full-scale bereik van de magnetometer in gauss. Moet een van de volgende "
"zijn: ``4``\\ , ``8``\\ , ``12`` of ``16``\\ ."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:74
msgid ""
"Write a hard-iron offset vector into the magnetometer's ``OFFSET_REG_*_M`` "
"registers. The offset is given in the same units as :meth:`magnet` returns "
"(gauss); each component is converted to raw LSBs using the configured "
"magnetometer scale before being written."
msgstr ""
"Schrijf een hard-iron offsetvector naar de ``OFFSET_REG_*_M``\\ -registers "
"van de magnetometer. De offset wordt opgegeven in dezelfde eenheden als "
":meth:`magnet` teruggeeft (gauss); elke component wordt naar ruwe LSB's "
"geconverteerd met behulp van de geconfigureerde magnetometerschaal voordat "
"deze wordt geschreven."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:82
msgid ""
"Return the single-byte ``WHO_AM_I`` register value of the "
"accelerometer/gyroscope sub-device."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de waarde van het enkele-byte ``WHO_AM_I``\\ -register van het "
"subapparaat van de versnellingsmeter/gyroscoop terug."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:87
msgid ""
"Return the single-byte ``WHO_AM_I`` register value of the magnetometer sub-"
"device."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de waarde van het enkele-byte ``WHO_AM_I``\\ -register van het "
"subapparaat van de magnetometer terug."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:92
msgid "Return the gyroscope vector ``(x, y, z)`` in degrees per second."
msgstr "Geeft de gyroscoopvector ``(x, y, z)`` in graden per seconde terug."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:96
msgid ""
"Return the acceleration vector ``(x, y, z)`` in units of standard gravity (1"
" g = 9.81 m/s²)."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de versnellingsvector ``(x, y, z)`` terug in eenheden van standaard "
"zwaartekracht (1 g = 9.81 m/s²)."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:101
msgid "Return the magnetic-field vector ``(x, y, z)`` in gauss."
msgstr "Geeft de magnetische-veldvector ``(x, y, z)`` in gauss terug."

#: ../../library/lsm9ds1.rst:105
msgid ""
"Generator that yields ``(gyro, accel)`` tuples for every sample currently "
"available in the FIFO and stops once the FIFO is empty. Each component "
"vector has the same units as :meth:`gyro` and :meth:`accel` respectively."
msgstr ""
"Generator die ``(gyro, accel)``\\ -tuples oplevert voor elk sample dat "
"momenteel beschikbaar is in de FIFO en stopt zodra de FIFO leeg is. Elke "
"componentvector heeft respectievelijk dezelfde eenheden als :meth:`gyro` en "
":meth:`accel`\\ ."
